    <h3 class="tc-title">線上站台新增紅包活動表單：固定欄位、活動幣種預設、活動時間選項</h3>
    <div class="tc-pills">
      <span class='pill pill-grounded'>grounded · 已確認</span>
      <span class='pill pill-neutral'>優先 medium</span>
      <span class='pill pill-risk-medium'>風險 medium</span>
